Package: veyon-plugin-internetaccesscontrol
Architecture: amd64
Depends: veyon (>= 4.11), veyon (<< 4.12), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Veyon plugin for blocking internet access on managed computers
 Internet Access Control adds a "Block Internet" button to Veyon Master. On
 managed Windows computers it blocks outbound web or all non-LAN traffic via
 Windows Firewall while keeping local network access and Veyon itself working.
 .
 On Linux this package provides the Veyon Master and Veyon Configurator side
 of the plugin.
